From k267/knarr k33: for inline-only engines (Gemini, Ollama native, LMStudio native, OllamaOpenAI, Cerebras, Moonshot) a from_url image is fetched synchronously with LWP while building the request, even on the _f path inside an IO::Async loop — blocks the loop (knarr/skeid serve many requests). Make the fetch async on _f paths (prefetch images via the engine's async HTTP before request build, or a Content::Image->ensure_base64_f), keep sync behavior for sync calls. langertha-async-worker.
